ner with PostgreSQL 15.\\n\\n?? Once running, open your web browser at: **`http://localhost:8080`**\",\r\n    \"intent\":  \"HOW_TO_RUN\",\r\n    \"status\":  \"INFO\",\r\n    \"timestamp\":  \"2026-09-12T21:57:28.7834548\"\r\n}\r\n{\r\n    \"reply\":  \"?? **How to Log In to the System**:\\n\\n1. Navigate to the login page: **[http://localhost:8080/login](/login)**\\n2. Use one of the pre-configured demo roles (or click the demo card on the login screen to auto-fill):\\n\\n�?� **System Administrator**:\\n  - Username: `admin` | Password: `Admin@12345`\\n  - *Full administrative control, revoking certificates, viewing audit logs \\u0026 telemetry.*\\n\\n�?� **University Registrar Officer (e.g. ZOU)**:\\n  - Username: `officer_zou` (or `officer`) | Password: `Officer@12345`\\n  - *Issue new academic degrees and manage university qualifications.*\\n\\n�?� **Accredited Verifier**:\\n  - Username: `verifier` | Password: `Verifier@12345`\\n  - *Inspect blockchain proofs, verify qualifications, and run AI anomaly scans.*\",\r\n    \"intent\":  \"HOW_TO_LOGIN\",\r\n    \"status\":  \"INFO\",\r\n    \"timestamp\":  \"2026-09-12T21:57:28.7915569\"\r\n}\r\n\n"}
