{"step_index":410,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:57:50Z","content":"I have updated the **QVS Agentic AI Assistant** to eliminate hallucinations and accurately answer questions about running the system, system features, logging in, and verifying credentials.\n\n### What Was Enhanced:\n\n1. **New System & Operational Knowledge Base**:\n   - **\"What does the system do?\"**: Explains the platform's core capabilities, including instant credential verification, immutable SHA-256 blockchain ledger, multi-vector AI fraud detection, RBAC roles, and real-time JVM telemetry.\n   - **\"How to run the system?\"**: Provides direct commands for:\n     - Windows quick run: `run-app.bat`\n     - Maven: `mvn clean test` and `mvn spring-boot:run`\n     - Production Docker Compose: `docker compose up --build`\n   - **\"How to log in to the system?\"**: Details the login URL (`/login`) and provides exact demo account credentials:\n     - **Admin**: `admin` / `Admin@12345` (revocations, telemetry, audit logs)\n     - **University Officer**: `officer_zou` / `Officer@12345` (issuing degrees, institutional registry)\n     - **Verifier**: `verifier` / `Verifier@12345` (blockchain checks, AI fraud scanner)\n\n2. **Accurate Credential Verification (Zero Hallucinations)**:\n   - Queries directly against the live database and blockchain ledger without guessing or fabricating data.\n   - Lookups work for students and certificate codes (e.g. asking *\"Check EH250001\"* returns Sekai Mataranyika's ZOU Postgraduate Diploma in Education with its 90/100 Low Risk AI score; asking *\"Check ITM 190020\"* returns Itai Muringani's ZOU BSc Honours in IT).\n\n3. **UI & Quick Prompt Buttons**:\n   - Updated the initial welcome message in the chatbot widget.\n   - Added clickable quick-prompt pills inside the chat window:\n     - `What does system do?`\n     - `How to run?`\n     - `How to log in?`\n     - `Check EH250001`\n     - `Explain Blockchain`\n   - Widened the chat drawer to **420px** with responsive margins for clean readability.\n\nThe updated app is packaged, tested, and actively running at **`http://localhost:8080`**."}
